+2. `GET /todos?overdue=true`: Store um `list({ overdueOnly })` erweitern —
+   Filter: `!todo.done && todo.dueDate && todo.dueDate < todayUtc()`.
+   `todayUtc()` = `new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)`.
+3. `npm test` grün (inkl. neuer HTTP-Tests aus Task 3).
+
+## Task 5: API-Tests — overdue-Filter (TDD)
+
+In `test/app.test.mjs`:
